=== (A) pigeonhole: mu_1/7=1 for k<=7 ===
  k=3: min mu_1/7 = 1 (~1.000000) over 21 bounded + 2000 random ; minimizer=all=1
  k=4: min mu_1/7 = 1 (~1.000000) over 56 bounded + 2000 random ; minimizer=all=1
  k=5: min mu_1/7 = 1 (~1.000000) over 126 bounded + 2000 random ; minimizer=all=1
  k=6: min mu_1/7 = 1 (~1.000000) over 252 bounded + 2000 random ; minimizer=all=1
  k=7: min mu_1/7 = 1 (~1.000000) over 462 bounded + 2000 random ; minimizer=all=1

=== (B) m_P = min_{|P|<=10} meas(G_P) ===
  |P|= 0: min meas(G_P)=1 (~1.000000) at P=()
  |P|= 1: min meas(G_P)=6/7 (~0.857143) at P=(1,)
  |P|= 2: min meas(G_P)=66/91 (~0.725275) at P=(1, 13)
  |P|= 3: min meas(G_P)=55/91 (~0.604396) at P=(1, 12, 13)
  |P|= 4: min meas(G_P)=1979/4004 (~0.494256) at P=(1, 11, 12, 13)
  |P|= 5: min meas(G_P)=2243/5880 (~0.381463) at P=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9)
  |P|= 6: min meas(G_P)=3029/10780 (~0.280983) at P=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11)
  |P|= 7: min meas(G_P)=45107/229320 (~0.196699) at P=(1, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 13)
  |P|= 8: min meas(G_P)=2479/17640 (~0.140533) at P=(1, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 13)
  |P|= 9: min meas(G_P)=10601/114660 (~0.092456) at P=(1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 13)
  |P|=10: min meas(G_P)=14249/252252 (~0.056487) at P=(1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12, 13)
  m_P = 14249/252252 (~0.056487)   [claimed 14249/252252=0.056487]
  MATCH 14249/252252: True

=== (C) union floor for k>=8: min over admissible (P, consec E) of meas(G_P)+mu_1/7(consec)-1 ===
  consec mu_1/7 k=8..13: ['691/735', '247/294', '38/49', '1381/2205', '13823/24255', '477/1078']
  union floor (per-pair, consec) = 1891/5880 (~0.321599) at (k,P)=(8, (1, 5, 7, 8, 9))
  MATCH 1891/5880: True

=== (D) global-witness equivalence: free-phase exists  <=>  maxgap>1/7 ===
  tested 20000 (E,x); mismatches between 'free phase exists' and 'maxgap>1/7' = 0
  (equivalence holds <=> 0 mismatches)
